n24692.content:
\begin{lemma}[Order of $q$ modulo the conductor]\label{lem:order_q}
\lean{ArkLib.Lattices.CyclotomicModulus.orderOf_q_eq}\leanok
For $q \equiv 5 \pmod 8$ and $\alpha \ge 1$, the multiplicative order of $q$ in
